                        "answer_md": "The Assistance for Power Driven Chaff Cutter Scheme aims to reduce fodder wastage (25-30%) in dairy farming. By using a power-driven chaff cutter, farmers can efficiently chop green and dry fodder, ensuring better utilization and increased profitability.\n"
